            "body": "This release contains changes for datasets:\n\n- SARS-CoV-2 (nextstrain/sars-cov-2/wuhan-hu-1/orfs)\n- SARS-CoV-2 (Mature proteins) (nextstrain/sars-cov-2/wuhan-hu-1/proteins)\n- SARS-CoV-2 (BA.2.86) (nextstrain/sars-cov-2/BA.2.86)\n\n\n\n## SARS-CoV-2 (nextstrain/sars-cov-2/wuhan-hu-1/orfs)\n\n- Include the 4 newly designated Nextstrain clades 26C (PQ.16.1.1), 26D (RF.5), 26E (RK.1) and 26F (PJ.2.1). See <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1226>, <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1227>, <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1228> and <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1232> for details.\n- Add labeled mutations for clades 26A (XFG.1.1), 26B (XFG.3.4.1), 26C (PQ.16.1.1), 26D (RF.5), 26E (RK.1) and 26F (PJ.2.1) to help identify recombinants\n- Remove the outdated RBD immune escape and ACE2 affinity scores: the BA.2.86 dataset no longer outputs the ACE2 binding phenotype, and the reference trees no longer carry the `immune_escape` and `ace2_binding` colorings.\n- Add all 9 Pango lineages newly designated between 2026-09-07 and 2026-10-26. Unfold below to see a list of all newly included lineages with their designation dates:\n\n<details>\n  <summary> Newly included lineages, with designation date in parentheses</summary>\n\n- QF.2.7 (2026-09-07)\n- QF.2.3.1 (2026-09-07)\n- SV.1.2.2 (2026-10-13)\n- TM.1 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.1 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.2 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.3 (2026-10-13)\n- TN.1 (2026-10-13)\n- RP.3 (2026-10-13)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n## SARS-CoV-2 (Mature proteins) (nextstrain/sars-cov-2/wuhan-hu-1/proteins)\n\n- Include the 4 newly designated Nextstrain clades 26C (PQ.16.1.1), 26D (RF.5), 26E (RK.1) and 26F (PJ.2.1). See <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1226>, <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1227>, <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1228> and <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1232> for details.\n- Add labeled mutations for clades 26A (XFG.1.1), 26B (XFG.3.4.1), 26C (PQ.16.1.1), 26D (RF.5), 26E (RK.1) and 26F (PJ.2.1) to help identify recombinants\n- Remove the outdated RBD immune escape and ACE2 affinity scores: the BA.2.86 dataset no longer outputs the ACE2 binding phenotype, and the reference trees no longer carry the `immune_escape` and `ace2_binding` colorings.\n- Add all 9 Pango lineages newly designated between 2026-09-07 and 2026-10-26. Unfold below to see a list of all newly included lineages with their designation dates:\n\n<details>\n  <summary> Newly included lineages, with designation date in parentheses</summary>\n\n- QF.2.7 (2026-09-07)\n- QF.2.3.1 (2026-09-07)\n- SV.1.2.2 (2026-10-13)\n- TM.1 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.1 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.2 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.3 (2026-10-13)\n- TN.1 (2026-10-13)\n- RP.3 (2026-10-13)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n## SARS-CoV-2 (BA.2.86) (nextstrain/sars-cov-2/BA.2.86)\n\n- Include the 4 newly designated Nextstrain clades 26C (PQ.16.1.1), 26D (RF.5), 26E (RK.1) and 26F (PJ.2.1). See <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1226>, <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1227>, <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1228> and <https://github.com/nextstrain/ncov/pull/1232> for details.\n- Add labeled mutations for clades 26A (XFG.1.1), 26B (XFG.3.4.1), 26C (PQ.16.1.1), 26D (RF.5), 26E (RK.1) and 26F (PJ.2.1) to help identify recombinants\n- Remove the outdated RBD immune escape and ACE2 affinity scores: the BA.2.86 dataset no longer outputs the ACE2 binding phenotype, and the reference trees no longer carry the `immune_escape` and `ace2_binding` colorings.\n- Add all 9 Pango lineages newly designated between 2026-09-07 and 2026-10-26. Unfold below to see a list of all newly included lineages with their designation dates:\n\n<details>\n  <summary> Newly included lineages, with designation date in parentheses</summary>\n\n- QF.2.7 (2026-09-07)\n- QF.2.3.1 (2026-09-07)\n- SV.1.2.2 (2026-10-13)\n- TM.1 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.1 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.2 (2026-10-13)\n- SZ.3.1.3 (2026-10-13)\n- TN.1 (2026-10-13)\n- RP.3 (2026-10-13)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n",
